      "id": "claim_a794ab1fe5ff42aaa17433bc387b19a5",
      "statement": "HttpUrlSpec is a security control, not a formatting nicety: it accepts only candidates whose trimmed lowercase form starts with http:// or https://, blocking javascript:, data:, file: and other schemes from being persisted as tappable external-identifier links (feature 009 finding #1).",
