      "id": "claim_7f26ea9b69ff4c0e9142d1bdbd81e9fc",
      "statement": "MovieUniqueInCollectionSpec is a documentation-only placeholder: it is a unit struct with no Specification implementation at all, and per-collection movie uniqueness is actually enforced by a MongoDB compound collation index on {collectionId, title, year, contentType} in the Adapters layer (E11000 → DomainError::DuplicateMovie).",
