      "id": "claim_f28e870ca38747a59a28ad2d3d4c330e",
      "statement": "The Specification<T: ?Sized> trait exposes only the predicate is_satisfied_by(candidate) -> bool plus AndSpec/OrSpec/NotSpec combinators; it does not itself raise DomainError — the calling application-layer handler converts a false predicate into an error, as create_movie does for title and the owned/ripped cross-field rules.",
